    description: "Found 2026-10-06 while fixing discovery.py docstrings (code-read only, not reproduced). discovery.find_files fast path checks only index.repo_root == repo_root and serves index.match_pattern, so a caller passing excludes stricter than the index's (FileIndex.build(..., excludes=combined_excludes) in cli.py ~:12175) gets them silently dropped. Callers that pass custom excludes: sketch.py ~:2683 (extra_excludes branch is pragma no-cover), sketch.py ~:4948 (DEFAULT_EXCLUDES), profile.py ~:939. Decide: compare excludes and fall back to rglob when they differ (what the old docstring said), or filter index results by the caller's excludes. Needs a repro first: a stricter-exclude call under an installed index."  # 04b2
    fields: {}  # 04b2
